      "id": "edcbc7c7-3847-4377-9d04-0d85e890ace5",
      "name": "Program Gateways",
      "description": {
        "content": "// Conditional snippet for beta or internal content\ninclude::../../maturity-admonition-banner.adoc[]\n\nUse the Credit Program Gateways endpoints to create, retrieve, and update Program Gateways for your credit program.\nA Program Gateway allows you to exchange messages with Marqeta's credit platform regarding decisions on transaction authorizations.\n\nFor more on Program Gateways, see <</developer-guides/about-credit-program-gateways, About Credit Program Gateways>>.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
